{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【璀璨之城】<strong>第七集</strong>精華 記者會踢爆官家陰謀！海允飽受輿論壓力</p><p>尚利鋒危機得以解除，麗欣的悲劇卻令海允深陷道德陰影，輿論亦視她為事件元兇。官家眾人冷血地討論善後；海允為平息風波，試圖通過成立基金安撫立風，卻遭雪瑩破壞，海允因此陷入危機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:39:38.061762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:57:56.041300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:37.164430+00:00","content_hash":"9854c86cdb110acb8a225cf9bb8af2ae9c671db1333b43bffdf06b4556a12a97","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}